    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37021" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαφ-ίστημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>remove,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ἁμαρτίαι . . ἐξαπέστησαν τὰ ἀγαθὰ
				ἀφ᾽ ὑμῶν</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Je.</u>
				5.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dispatch,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφ᾽ οὓς καθήκει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					1253.16
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, with aor. 2, pf., and plpf.
			
				Act.
			, <i>depart</i> or <i>withdraw from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					561
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				479
			</span></i>; <i>grow out of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡλικίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLond.</u>
					5.1708.263
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>.</div>
